BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Kong Mexico City|Demystifying Intelligent Model Routing: What Work
 s…and What Doesn’t|Online
DTSTART:20261203T100000
CATEGORIES:ai,security
DESCRIPTION:Kong/MEXICO-CITY\nMulti-model architectures are becoming the d
 efault\, and intelligent routing is often pitched as the layer that makes 
 them simple and more cost effective. The reality is much more complicated.
 \nIn this session\, Kong experts share where model routing is heading and 
 which ideas don’t hold up in production. We’ll explore different routi
 ng philosophies and which philosophies work best for coding harness\, chat
 bot\, and other agentic use cases.\n**What you’ll learn:**\n\n* Why rout
 ing logic belongs in the infrastructure layer as you adopt more models and
  providers\n* Why most routing claims in the market are questionable at be
 st\n* Where and when to use certain routing strategies to improve cost eff
 iciency\, quality\, security\, and resilience
LOCATION:Online event\,
END:VEVENT
